## 1. Ownership and Protection

visionAid is a proprietary assistive-technology project under development. Its purpose is to explore the use of artificial intelligence, computer vision, and related technologies to assist blind and low-vision people with everyday activities and environmental awareness.

Subject to applicable law and third-party rights, the rights holder retains all rights to original materials they own or are legally entitled to control, including original source code, documentation, designs, graphics, branding, and other protected project materials.

The project has been under development for approximately five months as of October 2026 and remains in active development.

